        "Title": "Crime Scene Cleaner&amp;Assassin #2",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103815805968",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 28450743-2507-48bf-9b30-e3a47e942faa).Image",
        "Description": "Hey,47\rI believed your superior,Diana,introduced some information about me.\rI&apos;m Big Jim,a criminal and a boss.Your experiences are so impressed,I want you to wipe out some guys.\rSergio,was one of my employee,but now he works for bodyguard in a town at Sapienza.Before this,he stole my folding knife,and ran to Italy now;Emilio and Claudio,they are so lazy,and betrayed me for Silvio Caruso.I need you to kill them,and leave the scene with nothing happened.\r--Big Jim",
        "GameVersion": "8.16.0.0",
